    ('537842d8-96e1-4fb5-a31d-deb1092e3bb8', 21, $$$$),
    ('537842d8-96e1-4fb5-a31d-deb1092e3bb8', 22, $$He fovourite person is her nephew, Dalvin. The princess is always happy when her cousins are playing with her.$$),
